5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I think we should see how much work the treasurer actually does. Maybe the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a factual basis for the costs. I'll look at last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about how new people feel. I'll check the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know why people aren't coming as much. I'll look at weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Fairness is the issue here. I'll examine the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, do you think the bank statements will show if people struggle to pay?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Likely. It will show the timing of the cash flow, which is essential for a stable budget.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,pass,Minako,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, do you think the sign-in sheets will show if only a few people are doing everything?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,That is exactly what I intend to find out.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll also check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners to see if that's a hassle.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
