60,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A seems easiest for the treasurer, but Option B might be too much work. Option C is a middle ground.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A provides the most financial certainty for those fixed costs. It's the only rational way to ensure stability.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option C reminds me of the named grades that caused friction. I dislike the visible distinctions it creates.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option B is what killed the weekday turnout. I can't support activity-based charging.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A ignores the unfairness of the ""ghost"" members. Option B or C would be more equitable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, if you dislike C, and @May dislikes B, is A the only peaceful choice?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"It is the most stable. We can handle the late payers with reminders, but we can't handle a deficit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,But A is a huge barrier for newcomers. They told us they won't pay for a whole year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,I agree with Minako. A flat annual fee is too steep a mountain for some to climb.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,So we are choosing between administrative ease and fairness. I still lean toward B or C.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm worried about the treasurer's hours. Option B is a nightmare. I think I prefer A or C.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the ""unfairness"" is a social issue, but the budget is a survival issue. We need A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,"I'll vote against C because of the history of friction. Between A and B, A is less divisive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"If B is out, I'll consider A, provided we find a way to help those who can't pay all at once.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If the majority wants A for the sake of the treasurer and the budget, I'll concede, though it's not fair.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I think we've found a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
